# Gmail SMTP configuration
account didousidali@gmail.com
host smtp.gmail.com
port 587
auth on
user didousidali@gmail.com  
passwordeval "pass didousidali@gmail.com | head  -n1"
tls on
tls_starttls on
tls_certcheck off
from didousidali@gmail.com

# University SMTP configuration
